# Licensing

This repository is a monorepo that contains multiple packages released under
**different open-source licenses**. There is no single license that applies to
the whole repository — each package is governed by the `LICENSE` file in its own
directory.

| Package              | Path                  | License                          |
| -------------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| memax-cli            | `packages/cli`        | Apache License 2.0               |
| memax-sdk            | `packages/sdk`        | Apache License 2.0               |
| Developer Hub (docs) | `packages/docs-site`  | Apache License 2.0               |
| Ledger tokens        | `packages/ledger-tokens` | Apache License 2.0 (fonts: SIL OFL 1.1) |
| Compiler             | `packages/compiler`   | Apache License 2.0               |
| Claude Code plugin   | `plugins/memax` (and `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json`) | Apache License 2.0 |
| `/v2` API contract   | `packages/server/openapi/v2.yaml` | Apache License 2.0   |
| API server & worker  | `packages/server`     | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 |
| Design system (UI)   | `packages/ui`         | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 |
| Web app              | `packages/web`        | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 |
| Ledger components    | `packages/ledger`     | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 |
| Compile service      | `packages/compile-service` | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 |

The full text of each license is available at the repository root for
convenience:

- `LICENSE-APACHE` — Apache License 2.0
- `LICENSE-AGPL` — GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

When you use, copy, modify, or distribute any package, the license in that
package's directory governs. The Apache-2.0 packages (`cli`, `sdk`,
`docs-site`, `ledger-tokens`, `compiler`, and the Claude Code plugin in
`plugins/memax`) do not depend on any AGPL-licensed
package in this repository, so they may be used independently under Apache-2.0
terms. The `/v2` API contract, `packages/server/openapi/v2.yaml`, is
Apache-2.0 inside the AGPL server package so that the Apache-2.0 SDK can carry
the types generated from it.

Copyright 2026 MemaxLabs, Inc. See `NOTICE` for attribution details.
